"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"8700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1047","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[76,63,69,57,75,61],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"8700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1047","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,63,69,57,75,61],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"8700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,63,69,57,75,61],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"8700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1056","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,63,69,57,75,61],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"5850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[76,63,69,57,75,61],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"5850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1001605","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国将领，扬州会稽郡山阴（今浙江绍兴）人，东吴名将贺齐之子，官至灭贼校尉。御众严而有恩，兵器精饰，为当时冠绝。其子贺邵，东吴晚期重臣，官中书令、太子太傅，以直谏孙皓遇害；贺邵之子贺循，西晋太常、一代儒宗，会稽贺氏自此成为江南顶级士族。","tc":"吳國將領，揚州會稽郡山陰（今浙江紹興）人，東吳名將賀齊之子，官至滅賊校尉。御眾嚴而有恩，兵器精飾，為當時冠絕。其子賀邵，東吳晚期重臣，官中書令、太子太傅，以直諫孫皓遇害；賀邵之子賀循，西晉太常、一代儒宗，會稽賀氏自此成為江南頂級士族。","en":"A general of Eastern Wu, native to Shanyin, Kuaiji Commandery, Yang Province (present-day Shaoxing, Zhejiang). He was the son of the renowned Eastern Wu general He Qi, and rose to the rank of Colonel Who Eradicates Bandits. He governed his troops with discipline tempered by benevolence, and his armaments were exquisitely crafted, unmatched in his day. His son, He Shao, became an important minister in Eastern Wu's later years, serving as Secretariat Director and Grand Tutor to the Crown Prince before being executed for his outspoken remonstrances to Sun Hao. He Shao's son, He Xun, served as Minister of Ceremonies in the Western Jin and was a revered Confucian scholar of his generation, establishing the He clan of Kuaiji as one of the preeminent noble lineages south of the Yangtze.","jp":"呉の武将。揚州会稽郡山陰県（現在の浙江省紹興市）の人。東呉の名将・賀斉の子で、官位は滅賊校尉に至った。軍の統率には厳格でありながら恩情深く、兵器の装飾の美しさは当時随一と称された。子の賀邵は東呉後期の重臣となり、中書令や太子太傅を歴任したが、孫皓への直諫により殺害された。賀邵の子である賀循は西晋の太常にして当代随一の儒宗となり、会稽賀氏はこれ以降、江南屈指の名門士族として栄えた。","kr":"오나라의 장수로 양주 회계군 산음(지금의 절강성 소흥) 사람이다. 동오의 명장 하기의 아들이며, 관직은 멸적교위에 이르렀다. 무리를 통솔함에 엄격하면서도 은혜가 있었고, 병기를 정교하게 꾸며 당대 으뜸으로 꼽혔다. 아들 하소는 동오 말기의 중신으로 중서령과 태자태부를 지냈으나 손호에게 직언을 올리다 화를 입었다. 하소의 아들 하순은 서진의 태상이자 일대의 유종으로, 회계 하씨는 이때부터 강남 최고의 명문 사족으로 자리 잡았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1031515","remark":"统帅","surname":"贺","surnameTc":"賀","surnameEn":"He","surnameJp":"賀","surnameKr":"하","surnameOther":"","name":"景","nameTc":"景","nameEn":"Jing","nameJp":"景","nameKr":"경","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"贺景","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"